date-released: 2026-05-20
url: "https://github.com/boninom-marce/amphibian-birdnet-workflow"
abstract: >
  This repository provides an end-to-end technical framework and reproducible 
  protocols for the automatic detection of Patagonian amphibian acoustic signals. 
  By leveraging BirdNET-Analyzer and custom embedding-based classifiers, 
  it addresses analytical bottlenecks in Passive Acoustic Monitoring (PAM). 
  This project is supported by WILDLABS.net and Arm.
keywords:
  - "bioacoustics"
  - "passive acoustic monitoring"
  - "amphibians"
  - "machine learning"
  - "birdnet-analyzer"
  - "patagonia"
license: "MIT" 
